<title>USA: Mercantile Bankshares ups div, sets split.</title>
<headline>Mercantile Bankshares ups div, sets split.</headline>
<dateline>BALTIMORE 1997-06-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mercantile Bankshares Corp said it raised its quarterly dividend to $0.30 a share from $0.26 and declared a three-for-two stock split, both payable June 30, record June 20.</p>
<p>After giving effect to the stock split, the new dividend is equal to $0.20 a share.</p>
